# Trivy ignore template
#
# Format:
#   <VULNERABILITY_ID> [# optional reason and expiry]
#
# Keep this file small and time-boxed. Prefer fixing findings over ignoring.
# Revisit ignores regularly (for example monthly).
#
# Examples:
# CVE-2023-12345 # accepted risk: no fix available; review by 2026-09-30
# GHSA-xxxx-yyyy-zzzz # false positive in unused transitive dependency

